{"2527550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roll The Bones", "steam_appid": 2527550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roll The Bones is perfect for...</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/d64b66f09955f4c367f4cc3dca9774a6.avif?t=1785264239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras_big/d64b66f09955f4c367f4cc3dca9774a6.webp?t=1785264239 width=1560 height=1047 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Roll The Bones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>fast-paced roguelite</strong> game, where your survival depends on <strong>quick reflexes</strong> and <strong>magic dice</strong>. Explore the <strong>deep dungeons</strong>, collect new <strong>powers</strong>, and destroy your <strong>enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/e6c0c08ae2bd6c9fae384269bbc8c1f6.poster.avif?t=1785264239\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/e6c0c08ae2bd6c9fae384269bbc8c1f6.webm?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/e6c0c08ae2bd6c9fae384269bbc8c1f6.mp4?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Rolling Mechanic</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power comes from <strong>rolling the dice</strong>. Every die has six unique sides, and each side holds a different magical effect. Survival requires <strong>precise aiming and good timing</strong>, not just pure luck. However, the dice can still surprise you. Landing a <strong>Critical roll</strong> completely changes your attack and creates a <strong>massive chain reaction</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/50ea40490017f7bd9ffaa72ec3f7d9bc.poster.avif?t=1785264239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/50ea40490017f7bd9ffaa72ec3f7d9bc.webm?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/50ea40490017f7bd9ffaa72ec3f7d9bc.mp4?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Build Synergies</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two runs are the same</strong>. You can choose from a massive variety of spell-dice, upgrades, and artifacts. During your adventure, you will find <strong>rare modifiers</strong> that completely change how your spells work. For example, a simple fireball can become a bouncing attack that clears the entire room. You can create a build focused on <strong>raw explosive damage, freezing defense, or pure chaos</strong>. Combine your choices to find <strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/7fce5b329d96b6495545753621f74c95.poster.avif?t=1785264239\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/7fce5b329d96b6495545753621f74c95.webm?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/7fce5b329d96b6495545753621f74c95.mp4?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer Epic Bosses</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly bosses</strong> wait at the end of your path. These epic fights will test your skills to the limit. You must <strong>dodge complex enemy attacks</strong>, manage your spell cooldowns, and find the perfect moment to strike back. Only the most skilled players will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/f9091ec4ca754ed5d6db597e48f635ca.poster.avif?t=1785264239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/f9091ec4ca754ed5d6db597e48f635ca.webm?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/f9091ec4ca754ed5d6db597e48f635ca.mp4?t=1785264239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Hordes and Challenges</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are full of different enemies. Each enemy has unique attacks, so you must constantly <strong>adapt your strategy</strong>. You will also find <strong>special challenge rooms</strong>. Test your skills in these dangerous rooms to earn <strong>rare and powerful loot</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Roll The Bones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>fast-paced roguelite</strong> game, where your survival depends on <strong>quick reflexes</strong> and <strong>magic dice</strong>. Explore the <strong>deep dungeons</strong>, collect new <strong>powers</strong>, and destroy your <strong>enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla